<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dell Computer raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dell Computer raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Dean Witter said it raised its 1997 and 1998 earnings per share estimates on Dell Computer Corp, reiterating its outperform rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- raised 1997 view to $2.45 a share from $2.26.</p>
<p>-- boosted 1998 estimate to $3.35 from $2.80.</p>
<p>-- stock was up 2-3/8 to 84-5/8.</p>
</text>
